<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1000] Inconsistency: Jcloud changed credential format for Google Compute Engine</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1000</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Jclouds updated its version of the product, changed format of the file where a key is stored for Google Compute Engine.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;They also changed documentation which we rely on. That&apos;s why we must to update our implementation, comments, configs respectively.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
