                            <comment id="14577147" author="dmagda" created="Mon, 8 Jun 2015 13:05:13 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;New documentation:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://jclouds.apache.org/guides/google/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://jclouds.apache.org/guides/google/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Implementation example:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/jclouds/jclouds-examples/blob/master/compute-basics/src/main/java/org/jclouds/examples/compute/basics/MainApp.java&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/jclouds/jclouds-examples/blob/master/compute-basics/src/main/java/org/jclouds/examples/compute/basics/MainApp.java&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14578386" author="dmagda" created="Tue, 9 Jun 2015 06:14:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Support authentication with JSON key for Google Compute Engine.&lt;br/&gt;
Adjusted documentation.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The issue will be closed when TC is switched to ignite-6 and all test machines use JSON keys instead of PEMs.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14730665" author="dmagda" created="Fri, 4 Sep 2015 11:19:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Keys are updated on public TC.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
